TensorPyPy and MetaTensor additions
===================================

This file covers the TensorPyPy and MetaTensor additions to PyPy. Files that
come from upstream PyPy stay under PyPy's LICENSE file and keep their
copyright holders. This file does not relicense them.

The additions are:

  * everything under benchmark/
  * rpython/metatensor/
  * pypy/module/_metatensor/
  * lib_pypy/tensorpypy/
  * the TensorPyPy and MetaTensor changes to other files under rpython/,
    pypy/ and lib_pypy/

